  4.769517x

Primary end-to-end measured speedup:
  1.432995x

Custom compute cycles/op:
  1.050781

RVV baseline compute cycles/op:
  5.011719

Custom end-to-end cycles/op:
  6.937500

RVV baseline end-to-end cycles/op:
  9.941406

Static compute instruction-count ratio:
  5.000000x

Static end-to-end instruction-count ratio:
  1.500000x


9. Values NOT to use as hardware speedup
----------------------------------------
Do not use:
  whole-program Core-0 cycleCnt
  Guest cycle spent
  Host time spent

Those include startup, printf, control-flow, trap, and simulator
overheads outside the controlled benchmark region.
